theorem k215PushAStage2At2937 (u t w c a b v: nat): $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum2943 (k215PVector u w 0 c a b t 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum2953 (k215PVector u 0 0 c a b 0 (t, w) v)) $ = '(mpbi (k215PReacheq2 (k215PStateeq2 (k215PVectoreq8 add01))) k215PairMacro46_vectorAt2937);

