pub theorem k215PushParam2937 (u t w c a b v: nat):
 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum2937 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum2963 (k215PVector u b (t, w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage0At2937) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage1At2937) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage2At2937) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage3At2937) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage4At2937) k215PushAStage5At2937)))));

